phele samajhte hain ki HTML5 aakhir hain kya aur purani HTML se alag kyun hain.


1.HTML kya hain ?(The Backbone)
HTML(Hyper Text Markup Language) koi Programming Language nhi hain (isme koi login ya loop nahi hote). ye ek Markup Language hai.. iska kaam Browser ko yeh batana hain ki apki website ka structure kaisa hoga.

A.HyperText:: Aisa text jo aapas mein link ke zariye juda hoga(kisi link par click karke dusre page par jaana).

B.Markup :: tags ko use karke text ko "mark" karna taaki browser samajh sake ki kaun se text headling hain aur kaun sa paragraph.



2.Modern HTML5 vs Purani HTML`
pheble (HTML4 mein) agar websites par video chalani hoti thi, Toh Adobe Flash Player jaise external software ki zaroorat padti thi . HTML5 ne aakar sab badal diya . Isne browser ko itna strong bana diya ki wo bina kisi Software ke video, audio, graphics, aur heavy animations ko akele  run kr skta hain.

3.Core Engine(The BoilerPplate)Deep Dive
jab hum VS Code mein (! )daba kr enter krte hain toh   yeh code aata hain . iski ek-ek line ka asli matlab samajhiye.


<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
    
</body>
</html>


<!DOCTYPE HTML> : ye koi HTML tag nahi hain. ye ek Declaration hain jo browser ko btata hain ki  ye Modern HTML5 ka code hain, ise naye rule se chalao.
"Agar aap ise nahi likhenge, toh browser Quirks mode(purane zamane ke tareeke ) mein chala jayega aur naye tags support nahi karenge".


